rooms_desc ({"This is the entrance room to Gorlin's Manor.You can leave your shoes and your travel clotheshere, and there is also a shelf to put hats on it.You see one of Gorlin's housekeeping faeries bust-ling through the room, cleaning a speck of dust from your dirty travel clothes (That's Gorlin'shousekeeping service...since he is absolutelyunable to keep his house clean by himself, heasked some friendly faeries to do this job. Givethem a candy if you see them, please.)","This is a hallway in the southern part of the manor.You can see a shelf with something on it.","This is a comfortable living room. It contains a table withsome very comfortable chairs around it, a bar, and acupboard. Through the windows to the east you can seea garden.","This is Gorlin's garden. He often comes here to relax abit after having one of his tedious adventures. Youcan see many flowers here, and their scent refreshensyou. To the east you can see a path through the bushes.","You now can see a beautiful pond in Gorlin's garden.This is also a place for relaxation and meditation.Feel free to rest here!","You have entered Gorlin's bedroom. It is tastefullydecorated. You can see a bed here. There also aretwo cupboards and a chest in this room.","This is Gorlin's workroom. Since he doesn't work overly much,it is currently very empty. But you can expect, that when hefinally becomes a wiz it will get quite crowded in here.","You are in a jungle north of the garden. A small path leadssouth. From the north water flows down to a sparkling waterfall,leading the clear water to a little pond. You hear birdschirping in the vicinity. In the middle of a little clearingstands a jacuzzi.","This is a small shrine full of flowers. On a white stonethere is a portrait showing Amy, Gorlin's great love.Gorlin often comes here just to look at her portrait....","This room is used for special occasions, like partiesand other festivities.At the moment it is empty and unused.",})
rooms_short ({"Entrance","Hallway","Living Room","The Garden","The Pond","Bedroom","Workroom","Amy's Place","Small Shrine","Empty Room",})
